  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_accept_1_gil" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_accept_1_gil">真的假的？太棒了！孩子们今晚就吃！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_art_1_gil" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_art_1_gil">过期甜甜圈！味道不够好，但是一样能购买高级内容。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_art_2_misc" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_art_2_misc">甜甜圈低至7.5折！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_art_3_misc" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_art_3_misc">额外25%甜甜圈！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_decline_1_gil" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_decline_1_gil">行行好，帮帮Gil嘛。不然他们会要了我的肾的。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_start_1_gil" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_start_1_gil">老Gil今天有特惠哦，Springfield。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_start_2_gil" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_start_2_gil">过期甜甜圈！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_start_3_homer" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_start_3_homer">嗯……甜甜圈。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_start_4_lisa" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_start_4_lisa">你不是真要吃那些过期的甜甜圈吧？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_dayolddonuts_" suffix="dlg_start_5_homer" key="promo_dayolddonuts_dlg_start_5_homer">当然不，我要用它们购买Frink教授，让他造一架时间机器，然后回到甜甜圈还新鲜的时候。再吃了它们。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_accept_1_homer" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_accept_1_homer">很抱歉说了你那么多坏话，Gil。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_accept_2_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_accept_2_gil">嗨，没事。下次我回来时你帮我买个Duff就行了。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_accept_3_homer" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_accept_3_homer">别回来。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_art_1_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_art_1_gil">获得Duff啤酒厂，搭上它那狂热的公司骗子Duffman！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_art_2_misc" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_art_2_misc">包括$50,000、Springfield标志、Duffman和Duff啤酒厂！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_decline_1_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_decline_1_gil">如果您改变主意了，您可以在高级物品菜单中找到该项促销。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_decline_2_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_decline_2_gil">不过如果你那样买的话，我一分钱的佣金都挣不到。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_1_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_1_gil">别紧张，Gil。就像排练一样。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_2_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_2_gil">打搅一下，这位大爷——</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_3_homer" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_3_homer">怎么又是你？你是这个城镇里最烦人的！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_4_homer" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_4_homer">你知道每个人都讨厌你吗？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_5_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_5_gil">真的吗？为什么？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_6_homer" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_6_homer">因为你是支广告。我们是人，我们做有趣的事情并赚钱。而你就只是支广告。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_7_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_7_gil">哎呀。我就是想挣出孩子的支架钱……用在腿上那种，不是用嘴里的。 </str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_8_homer" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_8_homer">啊，算了。我才不在乎你卖什么呢。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_9_gil" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_9_gil">Duff啤酒厂，搭上Duffman。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_10_homer" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_10_homer">真的？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_" suffix="dlg_start_11_homer" key="promo_duffbreweryplusspringfieldsign_dlg_start_11_homer">Gil，你是最棒的！我爱你、我爱你、我爱你……</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_accept_1_frink" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_accept_1_frink">为科学欢呼吧！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_accept_2_kearney" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_accept_2_kearney">闭嘴，呆子！*一记老拳*</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_art_1_gil" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_art_1_gil">谁不想有个呆呆的白痴做邻居？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_art_2_misc" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_art_2_misc">还能得到这些别的东西！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_art_3_misc" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_art_3_misc">包括：Frink的实验室、Frink教授、$50 000和Homer佛像。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_art_4_misc" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_art_4_misc">值490个甜甜圈！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_decline_1_frink" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_decline_1_frink">就是那种对科学的不关心阻止了我们登陆火星！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_start_1_gil" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_start_1_gil">科学家呢！让你的科学家们过来！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_start_2_lisa" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_start_2_lisa">你不能出售科学家的创造！只有大学才那么干。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_" suffix="dlg_start_3_frink" key="promo_frinklabplusbuddha_dlg_start_3_frink">小女孩，听我说，我被一个人困在只有我懂的一种存在中很久了。我只想回来，被一个人关在我的实验室中。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_icecreamman_" suffix="title" key="promo_icecreamman_title">冰淇淋车</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_accept_1_hankscorpio" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_accept_1_hankscorpio">干得好，Gil。现在来奴隶整个人类，让你们都在我的矿产里工作。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_accept_2_gil" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_accept_2_gil">好耶，有工作了！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_art_1_gil" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_art_1_gil">有巨型激光才像个老大！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_art_2_misc" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_art_2_misc">包括：火山老巢、邪恶的超级天才Hank Scorpio和Springfield标志。</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_art_3_misc" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_art_3_misc">价值370甜甜圈！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_decline_1_gil" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_decline_1_gil">拜托！难道你不想从那些哥伦比亚人手里保护你的镇子？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_start_1_gil" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_start_1_gil">嘿，Springfield！你是否厌倦了“那个人”指指点点告诉你该做什么？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_start_2_homer" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_start_2_homer">哪个人？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_start_3_gil" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_start_3_gil">华盛顿的那个人！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_start_4_homer" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_start_4_homer">哪个华盛顿？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_start_5_gil" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_start_5_gil">没错，现在你可以对付得了我们的政府了，你可以把你的城市名字弄在山上，用死亡光束来保护它！</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_start_6_homer" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_start_6_homer">因为又有华盛顿州又有哥伦比亚去……有点奇怪。哥伦比亚不是个国家吗？</str>
  <str prefix="promo_lairsign_" suffix="dlg_start_7_gil" key="promo_lairsign_dlg_start_7_gil">是啊，真奇怪。</str>
